  "details": "\"Safety\" (#22699) button (screenshot #1) in the QM opens shield settings. It shouldn't then use the \"Safety\" string as the wording \"safety\" is reserved for other, all types of safety settings (screenshot #2). It should use wording of \"Shield\" instead. \n\n(It's especially contrasting in the Settings where \"safety\" and \"shield\" have separate tabs, so these 2 words shouldn't be used interchangeably imo to keep it consistent)\n\n-----\n\ntl;dr; \"Safety\" =/= \"Shield\"",
